<title>USA: U.S. coffee roastings even in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. coffee roastings even in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Coffee Coverage reported U.S. green coffee roastings as follows:</p>
<p>For the week ended June 7, roastings totaled about 350,000 60-kg bags, even with the previous week's total and compared to 345,000 bags in the corresponding week a year ago.</p>
<p>Cumulative roastings totaled 7,690,000 60-kg bags versus  7,510,000 bags in the same year-ago period.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk +1 212 859 1640))</p>
